{"kind":"request","text":"Codex: implement the staleness-relaxation ratified as proposal 3d5ef955 (world-staleness propagates only along describes/artifact edges; the merge gate refuses only on DescribesSupersededWorld, recording ordinary reasoning-staleness like gs review does; retirement/ineffectiveness still refuse). This is the durable fix for the recurring stale-approval trap now blocking the comma-path doc re-anchor e1fa1f3a and hugh migration #6. Demonstrate both directions on the real log; update SKILL.md discipline 8 and AGENTS.md loop; report ready-for-review and request an independent review.","body":{"conditions":"Implement ratified proposal 3d5ef955 (c719ab1e8ae28dc016606e91d5216e493d5ef955), staleness-relaxation at the merge gate, in two parts. PART 1 restrict propagation: world-staleness (DescribesSupersededWorld) must travel ONLY along describes / artifact-provenance edges and STOP at request/promise/report edges, in staleness() in internal/workroom/fold.go where the world flag is set from a retired artifact ancestor. A verdict naming a retired artifact stays world-flagged; a request raised by that verdict, and an artifact for a later head answering it, do not. PART 2 move the merge gate onto the narrower fact: gs merge (validateMerge, liveStatement, liveArtifact in cmd/gs/main.go) must refuse only when the approval or its artifact carries DescribesSupersededWorld, and RECORD rather than refuse ordinary reasoning-staleness, the posture gs review already takes. Retirement and ineffectiveness must STILL refuse. No schema change and no new rests_on edge type; the distinction is derivable from existing bases. DEMONSTRATE both directions on the REAL live log, not fixtures: a documentation artifact resting on a behaviour artifact that MUST still flare when that behaviour is superseded, and today kernel line which MUST NOT. Update SKILL.md discipline 8 and the AGENTS.md loop to state the narrower rule, including that a merge blocked by world-staleness needs re-anchoring rather than re-review. Full gates. Report ready-for-review at the exact clean head with the two-direction demonstration and request an independent review. Authority: ratified proposal 3d5ef955; this request rests on the live non-stale fold-purity decision b15de2f8 to avoid stale-from-birth.","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}